<title>USA: Danninger in spinal cage implant deal.</title>
<headline>Danninger in spinal cage implant deal.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN, Ohio 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danninger Medical Technology Inc said Monday that Cross Medical Products Inc, its subsidiary, has reached a license agreement with Polaris Biotechnology Inc to develop and market a spinal cage implant.</p>
<p>Spinal cage implants provide a supporting framework for bone in-growth for patients with spinal trauma, tumors, or degenerative diseases. The company said distribution of the spinal cage implant in the United States is subject to regulatory approval, which will involve clinical trials. International distribution is expected within the next year.</p>
</text>
